2,Metlatónoc Mixtec - mxv (Otomanguean) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/mxv/,"October 31, 2025 - Metlatónoc Mixtec – mxv is in the Otomanguean family, included in Otomanguean, Eastern Otomanguean, Amuzgo-Mixtecan, Mixtecan, Mixtec language class.","Mixtec, Metlatónoc",Otomanguean
