7,Mixtec - Endangered Language Alliance,https://www.elalliance.org/languages/mixtec,"Varieties of Mixtec, classified as being in the Eastern branch of the Oto-Manguean language family, are sometimes put together with Trique and Cuicatec languages into a larger “Mixtecan” grouping. Like all other members of Oto-Manguean family, Mixtec languages are tonal.There are also close connections to Amuzgo, another focus of ELA research.","Mixtec, Metlatónoc",Otomanguean
